OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog and mist generally lift but
OL,6,Fstubborn to clear in prone areas, with
OL,7,Fa dry and bright day to follow. Winds
OL,8,Fremaining light and feeling rather
OL,9,Fmild especially where fog clears.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining dry this evening
OL,12,Fwith clear spells. Mist and fog
OL,13,Fpatches redeveloping by the morning
OL,14,Faway from Cornwall. A chillier night
OL,15,Fthan Friday night with light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FMist and fog gradually lift,
OL,18,Fbefore a band of low cloud and patchy
OL,19,Frain moves south through the day,
OL,20,Fclearing by late evening. Light winds
OL,21,Fand temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
