OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying mostly fine and settled as
OL,7,Fhigh pressure continues to dominate.
OL,8,FSunny spells with the odd shower at
OL,9,Ftimes. Temperatures near average but
OL,10,Ffeeling chilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
